cmd-freepower-desc = Toggles free power: everything that runs on APC power works, even if the station has no power. Resets automatically at the next round restart.
cmd-freepower-help = Usage: freepower [on|off]   (no argument = toggle)
cmd-freepower-arg = on / off
cmd-freepower-enabled = Free power ON: all APC-powered devices now act as powered.
cmd-freepower-disabled = Free power OFF: devices use the real power grid again.
